      "body": "## Motivation\n\nYAML scalar values are converted to separate command-line tokens. A value such as `api-key: \"--host\"` is then interpreted as another option, so startup fails with `argument --api-key: expected one argument`.\n\n## Modifications\n\nUse `--option=value` when a scalar value starts with a dash. Add a regression using the server argument parser for dash-prefixed API keys and model names, including CLI overrides before and after `--config`.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nModel accuracy is unaffected. The registered server-arguments CPU test file passes: 317 tests and 151 subtests. The new regression fails on the base revision with the expected argument-parsing error.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nNot applicable; this change affects startup argument conversion.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format code with pre-commit.\n- [x] Add unit tests according to the contribution guide.\n- [x] Update documentation as needed (no public option or workflow changes).\n- [x] Provide accuracy and speed results as applicable (startup parsing only).\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style guidance.\n\n## Review and Merge Process\n\nReady for review by the server-arguments owners.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #39916002385](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39916002385)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #39916002273](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39916002273)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #39916002458](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39916002458)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
